  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia has a lot of balloons. \"Look, Lily!\" says Mia. \"I make animal balloons.\" Mia makes a red bear. Then she makes a black bat. \"Is it scary?\" asks Lily. \"No, it is funny,\" says Mia. Lily smiles.",
      "Leo comes to the door. He has a green hat. It has two big eyes. \"I am an alien!\" says Leo. \"Hello, Mia! Hello, Lily!\" Leo wants a balloon. \"A bear, please,\" he says. Mia gives him the red bear. Leo holds it and says, \"Thank you!\"",
      "Pip runs into the room. \"Woof!\" Pip hits the bat balloon. The black bat is on the floor. \"Is Pip angry?\" asks Lily. \"No, he wants to play,\" says Mia. Mia makes a small dog balloon. Pip sits next to Leo. They are happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Mia makes balloon animals for Lily and Leo. Pip hits a balloon, and Mia makes a small dog for him.",
